+/**
+ * @brief Abort incomplete preparation and join every actually created native worker.
+ * @param jobs Actual intrusive queue retaining every job/container through cleanup.
+ * @post Every successful create has completed its actual join before normal return.
+ * Join failure terminates before any owner is released or retried.
+ * Successful pthread_create does not prove worker entry. Every created thread is
+ * joined before any undo, communicator cleanup or job destructor, even when a
+ * later create fails. Workers never write the separate creation/join receipt.
+ */
